Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:01.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,KICK THE KIDS OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:01.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,OF THE BOOKSTORE AND
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:02.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,DRAIN THE WATER.
